ew-7.png\" alt=\"new\" class=\"update-icon\" data-date=\"2024-03-22\" loading=\"lazy\">\n                    枚数調整時の表示</h3>\n                <p>ボーナス中に枚数を調整すると液晶へ文字が現れ、これによって設定が示唆されます。</p>\n                <p>(ボーナス中の打ち方について)</p>\n                <table border=\"1\">\n                    <tbody>\n                        <tr>\n                            <th style=\"width:65%;\">表示パターン</th>\n                            <th>示唆内容</th>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://slolaboratory.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/wordofj__11.png\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>フレイム</p></td>\n                            <td>奇数設定示唆</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://slolaboratory.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/wordofj__29.png\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>ブリザード</p></td>\n                            <td>偶数設定示唆</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://slolaboratory.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/wordofj__28.png\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>メテオ</p></td>\n                            <td>設定2以上濃厚</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://slolaboratory.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/wordofj__30.png\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>ワードオブライツ</p></td>\n                            <td>設定2否定<br>&amp;高設定示唆</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://slolaboratory.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/wordofj__31.png\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>サンダーV</p></td>\n                            <td class=\"lv6\">設定6濃厚</td>\n                        </tr>\n                    </tbody>\n                </table>\n\n            <h4><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://slolaboratory.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/new-7.png\" alt=\"new\" class=\"update-icon\" data-date=\"2024-03-22\" loading=\"lazy\">\n                    表示パターン振り分け</h4>\n                    <div class=\"update-date\" data-date=\"2024-03-22\">2024/03/22更新</div>\n            <table border=\"1\">\n                <tbody>\n                    <tr>\n                        <th>設定</th>\n                        <th style=\"width:25%;\">フレイム</th>\n                        <th style=\"width:25%;\">ブリザード</th>\n                        <th style=\"width:25%;\">メテオ</th>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td>設定1</td>\n                        <td>49.9%</td>\n                        <td>49.9%</td>\n                        <td>ー</td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td>設定2</td>\n                        <td>41.7%</td>\n                        <td>56.4%</td>\n                        <td>2.0%</td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td>設定5</td>\n                        <td>52.2%</td>\n                        <td>40.8%</td>\n                        <td>3.0%</td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td>設定6</td>\n                        <td>40.8%</td>\n                        <td>55.2%</td>\n                        <td>1.0%</td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <th>設定</th>\n                        <th>ワードオブライツ</th>\n                        <th>サンダーV</th>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td>設定1</td>\n                        <td>0.2%</td>\n                        <td>ー</td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td>設定2</td>\n                        <td>ー</td>\n                        <td>ー</td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td>設定5</td>\n                        <td>1.0%</td>\n                        <td>ー</td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td>設定6</td>\n                        <td>2.0%</td>\n                        <td>1.0%</td>\n                    </tr>\n                </tbody>\n            </table>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"left\">\n                <h3 id=\"destination2\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://slolaboratory.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/new-7.png\" alt=\"new\" class=\"update-icon\" data-date=\"2024-03-22\" loading=\"lazy\">\n                    CTルーレット失敗時の表示</h3>\n                <p>CTルーレットに失敗したときのBIG終了画面では、液晶に登場するキャラで設定が示唆されます(復活したケースでもこの示唆は有効です)。</p>\n                <table border=\"1\">\n                    <tbody>\n                        <tr>\n                            <th style=\"width:65%;\">表示パターン</th>\n                            <th>示唆内容</th>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://slolaboratory.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/wordofj__33.png\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>テモヤン</p></td>\n                            <td>設定1・6示唆</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://slolaboratory.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/wordofj__32.png\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>ヘターレ</p></td>\n                            <td>設定2・5示唆</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://slolaboratory.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/wordofj__35.png\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>ヘーボン</p></td>\n                            <td>高設定示唆</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://slolaboratory.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/wordofj__34.png\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>サンライズ</p></td>\n                            <td class=\"lv5\">設定5以上濃厚</td>\n                        </tr>\n                    </tbody>\n                </table>\n\n            <h4><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://slolaboratory.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/new-7.png\" alt=\"new\" class=\"update-icon\" data-date=\"2024-03-22\" loading=\"lazy\">\n                    表示パターン振り分け</h4>\n                    <div class=\"update-date\" data-date=\"2024-03-22\">2024/03/22更新</div>\n            <table class=\"small-table1\">\n                <tbody>\n                    <tr>\n                        <th>設定</th>\n                        <th style=\"width:20%;\">テモヤン</th>\n                        <th style=\"width:20%;\">ヘターレ</th>\n                        <th style=\"width:20%;\">ヘーボン</th>\n                        <th style=\"width:20%;\">サンライズ</th>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td>設定1</td>\n                        <td>54.7%</td>\n                        <td>32.8%</td>\n                        <td>12.5%</td>\n                        <td>ー</td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td>設定2</td>\n                        <td>31.9%</td>\n                        <td>53.2%</td>\n                        <td>14.8%</td>\n                        <td>ー</td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td>設定5</td>\n                        <td>29.9%</td>\n                        <td>49.8%</td>\n                        <td>17.2%</td>\n                        <td>3.1%</td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td>設定6</td>\n                        <td>48.3%</td>\n                        <td>29.0%</td>\n                        <td>19.5%</td>\n                        <td>3.1%</td>\n                    </tr>\n                </tbody>\n            </table>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"left\">\n                <h3 id=\"destination6\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://slolaboratory.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/new-7.png\" alt=\"new\" class=\"update-icon\" data-date=\"2024-03-29\" loading=\"lazy\">\n                    CT中のカットイン発生率</h3>\n                <p>CT中に発生するカットインの出現率には設定差が設けられており、設定が高いほど出にくい傾向になります。</p>\n            <table border=\"1\">\n                <tbody>\n                    <tr>\n                        <th>設定</th>\n                        <th style=\"width:25%;\">CTレベル1</th>\n                        <th style=\"width:25%;\">CTレベル2</th>\n                        <th style=\"width:25%;\">CTレベル3</th>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td>設定1</td>\n                        <td>1/49.4</td>\n                        <td>1/33.2</td>\n                        <td>1/24.7</td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td>設定2</td>\n                        <td>1/52.1</td>\n                        <td>1/34.8</td>\n                        <td>1/26.1</td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td>設定5</td>\n                        <td>1/55.4</td>\n                        <td>1/36.9</td>\n                        <td>1/27.7</td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td>設定6</td>\n                        <td>1/59.1</td>\n                        <td>1/39.8</td>\n                        <td>1/29.5</td>\n                    </tr>\n                </tbody>\n            </table>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"left\">\n                <h3 id=\"destination7\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://slolaboratory.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/new-7.png\" alt=\"new\" class=\"update-icon\" data-date=\"2024-03-29\" loading=\"lazy\">\n                    CTレベルアップ当選率</h3>\n                <p>CT中にボーナスが成立するとレベルアップの抽選が実施され、その当選率に設定差があります。</p>\n            <h4>CTレベル1滞在時</h4>\n            <table border=\"1\">\n                <tbody>\n                    <tr>\n                       